  "raw_label": "appellant_lost",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "D.Ravichandran vs The Commissioner Of Food Safety And Drug ... on 1 August, 2024 Author: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan Bench: G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No.220 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 01.08.2024 Coram: The Honourable Mr. Justice G.K.Ilanthiraiyan W.P.No.22074 of 2024 and WMP.Nos.24054 & 24055 of 2024 D.Ravichandran ... P Vs The Commissioner of Food Safety and Drug Administration, O/o. the Commissioner of Food Safety and Drug Administration, DMS Campus, Annasalai, Chennai 600 006 ..... Respondent Prayer : Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of Constitution praying for the issuance of a Writ of Certiorarified Mandamus calli the records pertaining to the impugned order of transfer in R.No.39 2024/S12/FSD, dated 19.07.2024 on the file of the respondent and qu the same as illegal and consequently to direct the respondent to fr general transfer guidelines and then conduct the transfer counselin necessary for transfers among the Food Safety Officers in Tamilnadu within the time stipulated by this Court. For Petitioner : Mr.S.Louis For Respondent : Mrs.M.Sneha, Special Counsel for Health D 1/6 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P.No.2 ORDER D.Ravichandran vs The Commissioner Of Food Safety And Drug ... on 1 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/199940441/ 1 2. https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 3.",
    "facts": "The petitioner was appointed as Leprosy Inspector in the year 1988 and was posted at GLCU, Cuddalore. On 01.08.1997, his post was merged with Public Health and Re-Designated as Health Inspector Grade-l at Cuddalore Urban and came on transfers to Thooknampakkam Cuddalore District and then transferred to Sivakkam Government Primary Health Center, Chidambaram Taluk as Health Inspector Cum Food Inspector.",
    "arguments": "The respondent failed to frame any Rules so far for the Tamilnadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department. Without even conducting any counselling, mechanically the petitioner has been transferred to other District."
  },
